  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a copper pot over medium heat.",
    "Add chopped onion and cook until translucent.",
    "Add minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add chopped savoy cabbage and cook until slightly charred.",
    "Add diced nuka pickle and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Pour in coconut milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve hot in the copper pot."
